---
title: /note and memory-note capture routing
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant PI as PI runtime
  participant Skill as memory-note skill
  participant Tools as memory_* tools
  participant Vault as Vault (80_AI/ + 10_Weekly/)

  Note over User,Skill: Entry paths:<br/>(a) user types /note &lt;text&gt;<br/>(b) user states capture intent and skill is auto-invoked

  User->>PI: /note "text" or capture-intent prose

  alt deterministic /note
    PI->>Tools: resolve current target
    Tools->>Vault: append formatted line
  else smart routing
    PI->>Skill: invoke memory-note skill
    Skill->>Tools: memory_get_context()
    Tools-->>Skill: active project + plan + domains
    Skill->>Tools: memory_list_domains()
    Tools-->>Skill: existing domain names
    Note over Skill: decide target(s) from content + context
    Skill->>Tools: memory_resolve_capture_target(current)
    Skill->>Tools: memory_capture(target1, formatted_line)
    alt content also fits a domain
      Skill->>Tools: memory_resolve_capture_target(domain)
      Skill->>Tools: memory_capture(target2, formatted_line)
    end
  end

  Note over Tools,Vault: Routing precedence:<br/>1. plan active -> plan ## Log<br/>2. project active -> project notes.md<br/>3. no active project -> weekly inbox

  Tools-->>User: noted under target path
